{"nodes": [{"id": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_r9_functional_pair", "label": "R9 \u2014 the functional minimal pair", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pre-registered at decision-log row 77, commit c098fba, before rung1_mean_dow existed; scored against the five predictions as written, including the two that failed."}, {"id": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_rung1_mean_dow", "label": "models/ladder.py::rung1_mean_dow (reported, never served)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_rung1_robust_dow", "label": "models/ladder.py::rung1_robust_dow (median arm)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_dow_profile", "label": "_dow_profile(train, target, agg) shared path", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The refactor makes the two arms differ in exactly one argument; verified bit-identical to the pre-refactor median arm, and the aggregator swap is applied at all four central-tendency sites so no median/mean hybrid survives."}, {"id": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_the_crossing", "label": "The crossing \u2014 each functional better on the metric that elicits it", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Observed at both scaled venues in the predicted orientation, all four paired intervals containing zero: a direction, not a demonstrated effect. Replication across two independent venues is worth something; it is not worth the word 'shows'."}, {"id": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_bias_concealment_finding", "label": "The ruler conceals a threefold bias difference", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "At Beer Hall the functional swap removes roughly two-thirds of the bias while moving MASE by 0.009 \u2014 precisely the concealment the design was built to expose."}, {"id": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_trt_right_skew_falsification", "label": "Two River Taps falsifies the right-skew mechanism", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The median arm is biased negative and the mean arm worse still; reported as a failure of the stated mechanism rather than re-described as a success. Truncation after the May 2026 closure is a hypothesis, not a finding."}, {"id": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_ellel_intermittency_inversion", "label": "Ellel inverts the elicitation argument", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "At roughly 82% zero days the DOW mean is dramatically worse on both metrics because it is dragged up by rare large trading days; independent empirical support for taking Ellel off scaled error entirely."}, {"id": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_unconditional_assertion_defect", "label": "Generator asserted a conclusion its own number contradicts", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Third instance of this defect class (weather_diagnostic, 'covariates HELP', and this); fixed to branch on the sign and re-emitted from stored JSON with no re-run so the numbers stay the pre-registered ones."}], "edges": [{"source": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_r9_functional_pair", "target": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_rung1_mean_dow", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_r9_functional_pair", "target": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_rung1_robust_dow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_rung1_mean_dow", "target": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_dow_profile", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_rung1_robust_dow", "target": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_dow_profile", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_r9_functional_pair", "target": "brain_log_66_r9_functional_pair_result_the_crossing", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/66_R9_functional_pair_result.md", "sour